  "description": "Home Club Ltd. are delighted to present this ideally located two-bedroom city-centre apartment to the rental market. Situated in the heart of Dublin city centre, this well-located apartment offers comfortable accommodation together with the convenience of having an excellent selection of shops, restaurants, cafés and entertainment venues right on the doorstep. The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious open-plan living/dining area, separate kitchen, two double bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nProperty Features:\nTwo double bedrooms\nOpen-plan living/dining room\nSeparate kitchen\nBathroom\nEntrance hallway\nSecure underground parking space\nPrime city-centre location\nShort stroll to St Stephen’s Green\nClose to Trinity College and RCSI\nWalking distance to Grafton Street\nEasy access to Temple Bar\nExcellent selection of city-centre amenities on the doorstep\nStrictly no pets.\n\nThis property is ideally positioned, with St Stephen’s Green, Trinity College, RCSI, Grafton Street and Temple Bar all within easy walking distance.",
